@startuml
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 5

actor Cliente as C
participant API as API
participant Argon2 as A2
database DB as DB
participant Blockchain as BC

C -> API: POST /auth/login { email, password }
API -> DB: FIND user by email
API -> A2: argon2.verify(hash, password)
API -> API: sign JWT RS256 (access + refresh)
API -> A2: argon2.hash(refreshToken)
API -> DB: SAVE hashedRefreshToken
API -> BC: anchor(AUTH_LOGIN)
API -> API: setHttpOnlyCookie(refreshToken)
API --> C: 200 { accessToken, expiresIn }

@enduml
